{"route":"hyperlinks","routeLabel":"Hyperlink entries","scriptId":"0074","lineCount":80,"lines":[{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000012","line":12,"sourceId":"0074:000012","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　沙也加・あずさ・笛子・葉子の四人が揃っている。\n　男性陣はいない。","english":"Sayaka, Azusa, Fueko, and Youko were all present. The men were nowhere to be seen.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000013","line":13,"sourceId":"0074:000013","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　四人は円陣を組むように対峙している。\n　友人と言えども引き下がれない不可視の一線が、\n各々の背後に引かれているようだった。","english":"The four faced one another as if forming a huddle. An invisible line seemed to have been drawn behind each of them— a line none of them would step back over, not even for a friend.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000014","line":14,"sourceId":"0074:000014","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　面持ちはいずれも厳しい。\n　峻厳な態度が、周囲の空気を乾燥させている。\n　火花一つで火がつきそうなほどに。","english":"Every face was grave. Their stern bearing dried the very air around them until a single spark might have set it ablaze.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000019","line":19,"sourceId":"0074:000019","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　彼らはじゃんけんで決着をつけようとしていた。","english":"They intended to settle the matter with rock-paper-scissors.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000022","line":22,"sourceId":"0074:000022","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「じゃ、勝っても負けても恨みっこなし」","english":"“All right. Win or lose, no hard feelings.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000023","line":23,"sourceId":"0074:000023","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　四人の中央には椅子が一つ鎮座し、一粒の赤く熟\nれたサクランボウを乗せた皿が供えられている。","english":"A solitary chair sat enthroned in their midst. On it, as if on an altar, stood a plate bearing a single ripe red cherry.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000025","line":25,"sourceId":"0074:000025","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「いいわよ、やろう」","english":"“Fine. Let's do it.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000029","line":29,"sourceId":"0074:000029","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　それぞれの顔には、表現方法の異なる緊張がひと\nきわ走った。","english":"A different kind of tension flashed across every face.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000030","line":30,"sourceId":"0074:000030","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　沙也加は目を細め、あずさは歯を食いしばり、笛\n子は眼鏡の角度を直し、葉子はひねった拳の内側を\n見ていた。","english":"Sayaka narrowed her eyes, Azusa clenched her teeth, Fueko adjusted the angle of her glasses, and Youko peered into the palm of her clenched fist.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000032","line":32,"sourceId":"0074:000032","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「じゃあ」","english":"“All right.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000037","line":37,"sourceId":"0074:000037","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「じゃーんけーん―――」","english":"“Rock, paper, scissors—”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000038","line":38,"sourceId":"0074:000038","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「じゃーんけーん―――」","english":"“Rock, paper, scissors—”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000039","line":39,"sourceId":"0074:000039","speakerJa":"葉子","speakerEn":"Youko","japanese":"「じゃーんけーん―――」","english":"“Rock, paper, scissors—”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000040","line":40,"sourceId":"0074:000040","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「じゃーんけーん―――」","english":"“Rock, paper, scissors—”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000041","line":41,"sourceId":"0074:000041","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　四人の声が唱和する。","english":"Their four voices rose as one.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000043","line":43,"sourceId":"0074:000043","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「ぽん！」","english":"“Shoot!”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000044","line":44,"sourceId":"0074:000044","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ぽん！」","english":"“Shoot!”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000045","line":45,"sourceId":"0074:000045","speakerJa":"葉子","speakerEn":"Youko","japanese":"「ぽん！」","english":"“Shoot!”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000046","line":46,"sourceId":"0074:000046","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「ぽん！」","english":"“Shoot!”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000049","line":49,"sourceId":"0074:000049","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　果たして勝者は……葉子だった。","english":"And the victor was... Youko.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000054","line":54,"sourceId":"0074:000054","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「あああああっ！\n　うそーーーーーーっ！？」","english":"“Nooooo! You're kidding me!?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000056","line":56,"sourceId":"0074:000056","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「……無念……」","english":"“...How mortifying...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000060","line":60,"sourceId":"0074:000060","speakerJa":"葉子","speakerEn":"Youko","japanese":"「かっちゃった」","english":"“I actually won.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000062","line":62,"sourceId":"0074:000062","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「でも今のって……」","english":"“But that throw was...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000064","line":64,"sourceId":"0074:000064","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「うん、ちょっとタイミング遅かったよ？」","english":"“Yeah. You threw a little late, didn't you?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000066","line":66,"sourceId":"0074:000066","speakerJa":"葉子","speakerEn":"Youko","japanese":"「やりなおしますか？」","english":"“Should we try again?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000068","line":68,"sourceId":"0074:000068","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「でも後出しが成立するほど、\n　露骨ではなかったわね」","english":"“Not blatantly enough to count as a late throw.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000070","line":70,"sourceId":"0074:000070","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「うーん……」","english":"“Hmm...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000072","line":72,"sourceId":"0074:000072","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「沙也加ちゃん、大人」","english":"“You're such a grown-up, Sayaka.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000073","line":73,"sourceId":"0074:000073","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「プライドばかりが高いだけよ」","english":"“I'm just proud, that's all.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000075","line":75,"sourceId":"0074:000075","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……本当は、悔しいわ」","english":"“...The truth is, I’m disappointed.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000077","line":77,"sourceId":"0074:000077","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「何か」","english":"“Something about this...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000078","line":78,"sourceId":"0074:000078","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　眼鏡の輝きに瞳を隠し、笛子が言う。","english":"Fueko spoke, her eyes hidden in the gleam of her glasses.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000080","line":80,"sourceId":"0074:000080","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「不自然に、余裕があるわね」","english":"“You're strangely calm about this.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000082","line":82,"sourceId":"0074:000082","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“............”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000084","line":84,"sourceId":"0074:000084","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「そう？」","english":"“Am I?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000086","line":86,"sourceId":"0074:000086","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「……怪しい、かも」","english":"“...Maybe there’s something fishy here.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000088","line":88,"sourceId":"0074:000088","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「何か、隠し事が？」","english":"“Are you hiding something?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000090","line":90,"sourceId":"0074:000090","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　二人の視線は思いの外厳しく、沙也加はため息一\nつ、話し出した。","english":"Their stares proved sterner than Sayaka had expected. With a sigh, she began to speak.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000092","line":92,"sourceId":"0074:000092","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「実はね、私、以前……はじめてをもらっているの」","english":"“The truth is... my first time was a while ago.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000094","line":94,"sourceId":"0074:000094","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「なぬっ！？」","english":"“WHAT!?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000096","line":96,"sourceId":"0074:000096","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「い、いいい、いつっ！？」","english":"“Wh-wh-wh-when!?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000098","line":98,"sourceId":"0074:000098","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「何年か前……忍と親しくなった頃ね」","english":"“Several years ago... around the time Shinobu and I grew close.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000100","line":100,"sourceId":"0074:000100","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「そのとき私ははじめて……触れたの」","english":"“That was the first time I ever... touched one.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000102","line":102,"sourceId":"0074:000102","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「そ、それは……？」","english":"“Y-you mean...?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000104","line":104,"sourceId":"0074:000104","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「だから、触れたのよ」","english":"“Like I said. I touched one.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000105","line":105,"sourceId":"0074:000105","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　誰かの、唾液を飲む音が響いた。","english":"A loud gulp broke the silence.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000107","line":107,"sourceId":"0074:000107","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「な、何に？」","english":"“T-touched what?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000108","line":108,"sourceId":"0074:000108","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　意気込んだあずさの質問に、沙也加は無造作にこ\nたえた。","english":"Sayaka answered Azusa's eager question without the slightest ceremony.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000110","line":110,"sourceId":"0074:000110","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「異性そのものに」","english":"“A member of the opposite sex.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000112","line":112,"sourceId":"0074:000112","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“............”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000114","line":114,"sourceId":"0074:000114","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“............”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000116","line":116,"sourceId":"0074:000116","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「ストップ。つまり……触れたというのは……\n　ただ触った、だけ？」","english":"“Wait. When you say... touched... you mean that's all you did? Just touch him?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000118","line":118,"sourceId":"0074:000118","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「それまでは箱入りだったもので」","english":"“I had been very sheltered until then.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000120","line":120,"sourceId":"0074:000120","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「ブリスターパック入りだったんだね」","english":"“So you were factory-sealed in a blister pack.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000122","line":122,"sourceId":"0074:000122","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「？」","english":"“?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000124","line":124,"sourceId":"0074:000124","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「……文字通り……\n　はじめて……触れたってこと？」","english":"“...You mean, literally... that was the first time you touched him?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000126","line":126,"sourceId":"0074:000126","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「ええ」","english":"“Yes.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000128","line":128,"sourceId":"0074:000128","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「そんなので余裕になっちゃうわけ？」","english":"“That's all it takes to make you this calm?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000130","line":130,"sourceId":"0074:000130","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「なら、あずさはいつ彼にはじめて触れたか記憶し\n　ていて？」","english":"“Then, Azusa, do you remember the first time you ever touched him?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000132","line":132,"sourceId":"0074:000132","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　あずさは愕然とした。","english":"Azusa stared, aghast.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000134","line":134,"sourceId":"0074:000134","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「あぉ……」","english":"“Er...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000136","line":136,"sourceId":"0074:000136","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「価値観とは人それぞれのもの、そして何を尊ぶか\n　もまた個人によって変わってくるものよ」","english":"“Values differ from person to person, and so does what each of us holds dear.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000138","line":138,"sourceId":"0074:000138","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「確かに、そうだけど……」","english":"“That's true, but...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000140","line":140,"sourceId":"0074:000140","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「私にとっては大切な思い出だもの」","english":"“It's a precious memory to me.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000142","line":142,"sourceId":"0074:000142","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「それは揺るぐことなく、ここにあるから」","english":"“Because it remains here, and nothing can shake it.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000144","line":144,"sourceId":"0074:000144","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「おめでとう、葉子。頑張りなさい」","english":"“Congratulations, Youko. Do your best.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000148","line":148,"sourceId":"0074:000148","speakerJa":"葉子","speakerEn":"Youko","japanese":"「あい」","english":"“'Kay.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000149","line":149,"sourceId":"0074:000149","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　颯爽と沙也加は去っていった。","english":"Sayaka strode off with a flourish.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000151","line":151,"sourceId":"0074:000151","speakerJa":"あずさ","speakerEn":"Azusa","japanese":"「……おとなのおんな」","english":"“...A grown woman.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000153","line":153,"sourceId":"0074:000153","speakerJa":"笛子","speakerEn":"Fueko","japanese":"「何か釈然としないんですけど……\n　まあ、いいわ……」","english":"“Something about that still doesn't sit right with me... Oh, well...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000155","line":155,"sourceId":"0074:000155","speakerJa":"葉子","speakerEn":"Youko","japanese":"「じゃあ、いただきます」","english":"“Okay, then. Here goes.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000159","line":159,"sourceId":"0074:000159","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　葉子はサクランボウをつまみ上げると、口に放り\n込んだ。","english":"Youko picked up the cherry and tossed it into her mouth.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000164","line":164,"sourceId":"0074:000164","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　沙也加は。","english":"Meanwhile, Sayaka—","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000166","line":166,"sourceId":"0074:000166","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「…………」","english":"“............”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000167","line":167,"sourceId":"0074:000167","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　嘘は、ついていなかった。","english":"She had not lied.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000169","line":169,"sourceId":"0074:000169","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　ほう、と息を吐く。","english":"She let out a quiet breath.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000171","line":171,"sourceId":"0074:000171","speakerJa":"沙也加","speakerEn":"Sayaka","japanese":"「……笛子は、鋭いわ……」","english":"“...Fueko is perceptive...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000174","line":174,"sourceId":"0074:000174","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　はじめて触れた。","english":"It had been the first time she touched him.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0074:000175","line":175,"sourceId":"0074:000175","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　何も否定していない言葉であった。\n　常日頃から、人間関係に無用な刺激は必要ないと、\n沙也加は考えている。","english":"Not one word of it had been a denial. Sayaka had always believed in sparing human relationships needless friction.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]}]}